Package: acer-predator-ph315-51-fan-control
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, systemd, kmod
Description: manual fan control for the Acer Predator PH315-51
 fanctld is a root daemon that writes the embedded controller's fan
 registers directly. Members of the fanctl group talk to it over a Unix
 socket, so no sudo rule is needed. fanctl is the unprivileged CLI client
 (status/full/auto) and prints one line of JSON.
 .
 Register offsets are specific to the Acer Predator PH315-51 EC; the
 daemon refuses to start on other models.
